		"$comment": "Passages that name a crypto project other than $THREE are left out of every translation (they stay in the English original), because the operating rules gate committing any such reference. A passage is excluded when it matches tickerPattern, names a Solana address other than the $THREE mint, names a term in termsFrom (the owner's plaintext list), or names a term whose SHA-256 is in digests. The digest list names no project in plaintext for the same reason data/announce-gate-terms.json ships empty: the term itself is the gated name. Add one with `node scripts/i18n-docs.mjs --digest \"<term>\"` (lowercase match) or `--digest \"<Term>\" --case-sensitive`.",
